  "company": {
    "name": "Cumulocity",
    "tagline": "The leading independent AIoT Platform",
    "description": "Cumulocity is the independent AIoT platform company.\nHeadquartered in Düsseldorf, Germany, and founded in 2012, Cumulocity develops one of the world's leading open, device-agnostic AIoT platforms - trusted by enterprises, OEMs, and system integrators globally. In 2024, Cumulocity completed a management buyout to become an independent company, with a renewed and dedicated focus on its AIoT platform, customers, and partner ecosystem.\n\nWhat we do\nThe Cumulocity AIoT platform enables organisations to connect any device, manage millions of assets, analyse real-time and historical data, and rapidly build and deploy IoT applications - in the cloud, at the edge, or in hybrid environments. The cloud-native platform enables enterprises to adopt a \"Buy & Build\" approach, shortening time-to-market for innovative digital services. Cumulocity is the preferred choice for industrial equipment makers and is trusted by major brands to power their smart connected products in manufacturing, utilities, fleet management, and more. \n\nWhy independence matters\nAs a standalone AIoT software company, every engineering, product, and support investment we make goes directly into our platform and our customers. We remain open, neutral, and customer-led - integrating with any cloud, any device, and any enterprise system.\n\nIndustries we serve\nManufacturing, Utilities, Fleet Management, Healthcare, Telecommunications, Smart cities, Logistics, Energy, Machine building\n\nRecognition\nCumulocity has been recognised as a leading Industrial IoT platform by industry analysts including Gartner and Forrester.\n\nLearn more: www.cumulocity.com",
